n, depending on what kind of game you're running.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T00:37:13-07:00","id":1086094,"title":"","content":"<b>Re: Dragon stats</b><br /> <br /> Try this. I created this one under the Horror rules. <hr /><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Vestrisol \u2013 the Elder Dragon</b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Vestrisol is an ancient creature, a relic from a lost age where myth and legend lived. He is driven to accumulate power and wealth, forever adding to his vast hoard, and considers humanity and most other creatures to be useful tools and pawns. Every several hundred years he is compelled to slumber, and his plots take one an uncharacteristic urgency as that time approaches. He takes of a great delight in matching wits and might against beings of similar power and influence. The Dragon can assume human form, and appears as an athletic middle aged man with greying hair, dark skin, and yellow eyes.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Virtue:</b> Ambitious; <b>Vice: </b>Covetous<br /> <b>Aspiration: </b>Add resources and assets to his hoard.<br /> <b>Mental Attributes:</b> Intelligence 7, Wits 5, Resolve 6<br /> <b>Physical Attributes:</b> Strength 10, Dexterity 4, Stamina 7<br /> <b>Social Attributes:</b> Presence 7, Manipulation 5, Composure 6<br /> <b>Skills:</b> Academics 5(History), Athletics 4, Brawl 6 (Bite and Claw), Intimidation 7, Occult 5(Dragons), Persuasion 5, Politics 5, Socialize 4, Survival 4<br /> <b>Merits:</b> Eidetic Memory, Indomitable, Iron Skin 2 (Advanced), Resources 5, Trained Observer 3<br /> <b>Potency: </b>8<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 20<br /> <b>Size:</b> 16<br /> <b>Initiative:</b><br /> <b>Armor:</b> 2<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 8<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 22 (Species Factor 8); Flight 44<br /> <b>Health:</b> 23<br /> <b>Weapons/Attacks</b><br /> Bite and Claw [+1L melee; 17 dice]<br /> Wing Buffet and Tail Lash [+0B melee; 16 dice]<br /> Fire Breath +0L ranged; (Dexterity +Athletics; 8 dice)<br /> <b>Dread Powers: </b>Breath Weapon (Fire)*, Hideous Strength*, Madness and Terror, Numina-Mortal Mask, Regenerate, Unbreakable<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b><i>Breath Weapon:</i> </b>Horrors with this Dread Power can command the elements to destroy their enemies, often literally breathing gouts of fire or hurling bolts of lightning. Choose the type of attack when this Dread Power is selected; this is typically an element such as acid, fire, lighting or cold, but other, more exotic elements might be used depending on the nature of the creature. By spending 1 point of Willpower, the Horror can blast individual targets in range (5/10/15) that counts as a ranged attack with a thrown weapon and requires a roll of an appropriate dice pool \u2013 the opponent\u2019s Defense. This attack has a weapon bonus of +0. By expending 3 Willpower, the weapon bonus increases to +2 and inflicts the <i>Burning</i> Tilt.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Hideous Strength:</i></b> The creature\u2019s might is truly formidable; by spending a point of Willpower, the Horror can increase its Strength by its Potency until the end of the scene. Furthermore, it adds its Potency as automatic successes on Strength + Stamina rolls made to perform a feat of strength, such as lifting a massive object or breaking free of restraints.</span><br /> <br /> *Vestrisol\u2019s immense size grants him an additional 2 points of Strength</div></div> </div> </div></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target